(2326, 275, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"6b26969\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab3a1d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2>1. Introduction<\\/h2><p>Welcome to brubru.world, operated by Beresol BV. This privacy policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal data when you use our website.<\\/p><h2>2. Company Information<\\/h2><ul><li><strong>Company Name:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Beresol BV<\\/li><li><strong>NIF:<\\/strong>\\u00a0NL866248365<\\/li><li><strong>Address:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Zonnewende 181. 7325 Apeldoorn (The Netherlands)<\\/li><li><strong>Contact Email:<\\/strong> <a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">contact<\\/a><a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">@brubru.world<\\/a><\\/li><\\/ul><h2>3. Data Collection<\\/h2><p>We collect the following personal data from you:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Personal Identification Information:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Email address.<\\/li><li><strong>Usage Data:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Information on how you use our website, including your IP address, browser type, browsing habits, and referral source.<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>4. Purpose of Data Collection<\\/h2><p>Your personal data is collected for the following purposes:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>User Registration:<\\/strong>\\u00a0To manage your registration and participation in testing the mobile application.<\\/li><li><strong>Communication:<\\/strong>\\u00a0To communicate with you regarding updates, promotional offers, and other relevant information.<\\/li><li><strong>Website Improvement:<\\/strong>\\u00a0To analyze and improve the functionality and user experience of our website through Google Analytics.<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>5. Use of Google Analytics<\\/h2><p>We use Google Analytics to collect information about your use of our website. Google Analytics collects data such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages you visit. This data helps us understand website traffic and usage patterns. Google\\u2019s privacy policy can be found\\u00a0<a target=\\\"_new\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">here<\\/a>.<\\/p><h2>6. Data Protection<\\/h2><p>We are committed to ensuring the security of your personal data. We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.<\\/p><h2>7. Data Sharing<\\/h2><p>We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal data to outside parties except:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Service Providers:<\\/strong>\\u00a0We may share your data with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our website and conducting our business.<\\/li><li><strong>Legal Obligations:<\\/strong>\\u00a0We may disclose your personal data if required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities.<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>8. Your Rights<\\/h2><p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Access:<\\/strong>\\u00a0You can request access to the personal data we hold about you.<\\/li><li><strong>Correction:<\\/strong>\\u00a0You can request that we correct any inaccuracies in your personal data.<\\/li><li><strong>Deletion:<\\/strong>\\u00a0You can request that we delete your personal data, subject to legal obligations.<\\/li><li><strong>Objection:<\\/strong>\\u00a0You can object to the processing of your personal data under certain circumstances.<\\/li><li><strong>Data Portability:<\\/strong>\\u00a0You can request a copy of your personal data in a structured, commonly used, and machine-readable format.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">contact@brubru.world<\\/a>.<\\/p><h2>9. Cookies<\\/h2><p>Our website uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small text files stored on your device that collect standard internet log information and visitor behavior information. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.<\\/p><h2>10. Changes to this Privacy Policy<\\/h2><p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.<\\/p><h2>11. Contact Information<\\/h2><p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please contact us at:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Email:<\\/strong> <a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">contact<\\/a><a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">@brubru.world<\\/a><\\/li><li><strong>Address:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Zonnewende 181, 7325 Apeldoorn (NL)<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>Effective Date:<\\/strong> 6 November 2024<\\/p>\",\"custom_css\":\"h2 {margin-top: 40px}h2:first-child {margin-top: 0!important}\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
