ay update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.<\\/p><h2>11. Contact Information<\\/h2><p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data practices, please contact us at:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Email:<\\/strong> <a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">contact<\\/a><a rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">@brubru.world<\\/a><\\/li><li><strong>Address:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Zonnewende 181, 7325 Apeldoorn (NL)<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>Effective Date:<\\/strong> 6 November 2024<\\/p>\",\"custom_css\":\"h2 {margin-top: 40px}h2:first-child {margin-top: 0!important}\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
