"px\"},\"grid_align_items\":\"center\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"grid_gaps_tablet\":{\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true,\"unit\":\"px\"},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bf9dbdc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/brubru.world\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/brubru-aboutme.svg\",\"id\":58,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"0bf8472\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_justify_content\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"281808a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"title\":\"A propos de moi\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Roboto\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":55,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a2df5a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"editor\":\"<p>Apr\\u00e8s avoir travaill\\u00e9 au Parlement europ\\u00e9en pendant sept ans, o\\u00f9 j\'ai rencontr\\u00e9 de nombreux acteurs diff\\u00e9rents qui avaient besoin d\'aide pour naviguer dans les institutions europ\\u00e9ennes et les approcher, j\'ai d\\u00e9cid\\u00e9 de continuer \\u00e0 les aider.<\\/p>\\n<p>C\'est pourquoi j\'ai cr\\u00e9\\u00e9 cet outil d\'IA rempli de donn\\u00e9es sur l\'UE, ses institutions, ses proc\\u00e9dures, ses processus, ses lois, etc., avec des conseils et des solutions.<\\/p>\\n<p>N\'h\\u00e9sitez pas \\u00e0 utiliser