(15, 1, '2024-10-07 11:18:33', '2024-10-07 09:18:33', '<h1>Welcome to Brubru</h1>		\n			Your AI companion for navigating the EU bubble in Brussels.		\n			<h2>Discover your new bureaucracy companion</h2>		\n			<a href=\"#about\">\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M413.1 222.5l22.2 22.2c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L241 473c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L12.7 278.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.2-22.2c9.5-9.5 25-9.3 34.3.4L184 343.4V56c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h32c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v287.4l114.8-120.5c9.3-9.8 24.8-10 34.3-.4z\"></path></svg>			</a>\n			<form id=\"openai-form\">\n    <textarea id=\"user-input\" name=\"user_input\" placeholder=\"Ask Brubru anything...\"></textarea>\n    <button type=\"submit\">Send</button>\n</form>\n			<h2>About<br />Brubru</h2>		\n		<p>Brubru is designed to demystify the complex, bureaucratic nature of EU institutions, offering strategic guidance for effective advocacy and lobbying in Brussels. Brubru helps anybody who needs it to advocate their needs to the European Union main institutions and officials, to make amendments and resolutions, to learn how the European Union’s legislative processes work, and how not to get lost in the EU bubble’s labyrinth.</p>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"537\" src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-aboutus.svg\" alt=\"\" />													\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"552\" src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-aboutme.svg\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>About me</h2>		\n		<p>After having worked in the European Parliament for seven years, where I cloud meet many different stakeholders who needed help to navigate the EU institutions and approach them, I decided to keep helping them.</p><p>That is why I created this AI tool full of data about the EU, its institutions, its procedures, processes, laws, etc., with tips and solutions.</p><p>Feel free to us its free version and contact me if you wish to have a more tailored version of Brubru!</p>		\n			Victor Solé Ferioli		\n			Creator<br />\n<b>Brubru</b>		\n			<h2>Let\'s connect</h2>		\n		<p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to get in touch.</p>		\n													<img width=\"620\" height=\"857\" src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-contact.svg\" alt=\"\" />', 'Brubru', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'brubru', '', '', '2024-12-05 11:14:48', '2024-12-05 10:14:48', '', 0, 'https://brubru.world/?page_id=15', 1, 'page', '', 0),
