(61, 1, '2024-10-07 12:20:47', '2024-10-07 10:20:47', '<h1>Welcome to Brubru</h1>		\n			Your AI companion for navigating the EU bubble in Brussels.		\n			<h2>About<br />Brubru</h2>		\n		<p>Brubru is designed to demystify the complex, bureaucratic nature of EU institutions, offering strategic guidance for effective advocacy and lobbying in Brussels.</p>		\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"537\" src=\"http://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-aboutus.svg\" alt=\"\" />													\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"552\" src=\"http://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-aboutme.svg\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>About me</h2>		\n		<p>After having worked in the European Parliament for seven years, where I cloud meet many different stakeholders who needed help to navigate the EU institutions and approach them, I decided to keep helping them.</p><p>That is why I created this AI tool full of data about the EU, its institutions, its procedures, processes, laws, etc., with tips and solutions.</p><p>Feel free to us its free version and contact me if you wish to have a more tailored version of Brubru!</p>		\n			Victor Solé Ferioli		\n			Chief Executive Officer<br />\n<b>Brubru</b>		\n			<h2>EU Bureaucracy Services</h2>		\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1070\" open>\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1070\" >\n					 EU institutions Explained \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M177 159.7l136 136c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L160 255.9l-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 329.7c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l136-136c9.4-9.5 24.6-9.5 34-.1z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6