</li><li>Priority support with faster response.</li><li>Custom resources and outreach plans.</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact for pricing\n					</a>\n			<h2>Let\'s connect</h2>		\n		<p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to get in touch.</p>		\n													<img src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />', 'Brubru', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-07 12:25:44', '2024-10-07 10:25:44', '', 15, 'https://brubru.world/?p=64', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
