</li><li>Priority support with faster response.</li><li>Custom resources and outreach plans.</li></ul>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact for pricing\n					</a>\n			<h2>Let\'s connect</h2>		\n		<p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to get in touch.</p>		\n													<img width=\"620\" height=\"857\" src=\"http://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-contact.svg\" alt=\"\" />', 'Brubru', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-07 12:26:55', '2024-10-07 10:26:55', '', 15, 'https://brubru.world/?p=71', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
