www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1073\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1073\" >\n					 Legislative Procedures \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M177 159.7l136 136c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L160 255.9l-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 329.7c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l136-136c9.4-9.5 24.6-9.5 34-.1z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n					</details>\n													<img width=\"800\" height=\"904\" src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-services.svg\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h2>Our subscriptions plans</h2>		\n			<h2>White plan</h2>		\n		<p>Access to <strong>basic featured</strong>, including general guidance on EU institutions.</p><ul><li>Limited interactions per month.</li><li>Access to public document library.</li></ul>		\n								<a href=\"#\">\n									Sign Up!\n					</a>\n			<h2>Yellow plan</h2>		\n		<p>For individuals needing advanced guidance on EU advocacy.</p><ul><li>Unlimited interactions.</li><li>Personalizaed strategy recommendations.</li><li>Exclusive outreach templates.</li><li>Monthly legislative updates.</li></ul>		\n								<a href=\"#\">\n									Subscribe for 49€/month\n					</a>\n			<h2>Blue plan</h2>		\n		<p>For organizations requiring fully customized advocacy support.</p><ul><li>All features of the <strong>Yellow</strong><strong> Option</strong>.</li><li>Custom-tailored guidance and strategic assistance.</li><li>Priority support with faster response.</li><li>Custom resources and outreach plans.</li></ul>		\n								<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact for pricing\n					</a>\n			<h2>Let\'s connect</h2>		\n		<p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to get in touch.</p>		\n													<img width=\"620\" height=\"857\" src=\"https://brubru.world/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/brubru-contact.svg\" alt=\"\" />', 'Brubru', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '15-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 13:00:02', '2024-11-06 12:00:02', '', 15, 'https://brubru.world/?p=176', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
