2024/10/brubru-contact.svg\" alt=\"\" />', 'Brubru', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '226-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 13:05:57', '2024-11-06 12:05:57', '', 226, 'https://brubru.world/?p=230', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
